{PAUSE ""}
　Am I going to get attacked by <STYLE ID="2">that girl</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'm a little torn over whether to tell her the reason honestly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But if someone connected to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is hiding </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'ll lose her place to belong.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">So I can't say for certain that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> won't harm us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
