<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="2">Akina-chan</STYLE> probably has a lot going on, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　I want to respect that intention of yours, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
So please trust me. I'm not going to carelessly do anything <STYLE ID="2">Akina-chan</STYLE> would hate."<PG>
Goto-chan<STYLE ID="3">, I'd thought, would push things forward fast once she knew the whereabouts of </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="3"> had apparently been mindful of that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Come to think of it, even while suspecting </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> that much, she'd kept a step back.</STYLE><PG>
