<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, you're a police officer, investigating <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and the others. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> knows that too. 
{PAUSE ""}
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
even so, <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> stayed with you, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>."<PG>
"For <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>, being with you, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, could mean risking the loss of her place to belong. 
{PAUSE ""}
And if she stayed with you anyway... 
{PAUSE ""}
then I'm thinking, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, that you've surely become <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan's</STYLE> place to belong."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't be ridiculous... You're overthinking it. We only met today..."</STYLE><PG>
